---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Service — SnipTools"
  description="Terms of Service for using SnipTools free online developer tools."
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 md:py-16">
    <div class="mb-10 text-center">
      <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-accent bg-accent/10 border border-accent/20 rounded-full mb-3">
        Legal
      </span>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-text-primary tracking-tight mb-3">Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-text-secondary">Last updated: July 2026</p>
    </div>

    <div class="rounded-2xl border border-border-primary bg-bg-secondary p-6 sm:p-10 space-y-6 text-sm text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-text-primary mb-2">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
        <p>By accessing or using SnipTools (sniptools.tools), you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service. If you do not agree, please discontinue use of the site immediately.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="border-t border-border-primary pt-6">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-text-primary mb-2">2. Use of Free Tools</h2>
        <p>SnipTools provides developer utilities free of charge for personal, commercial, and educational use. You agree not to attempt to disrupt site functionality, scrape automated requests inappropriately, or use the service for unlawful purposes.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="border-t border-border-primary pt-6">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-text-primary mb-2">3. Disclaimer of Warranties</h2>
        <p>All tools on SnipTools are provided "AS IS" and "AS AVAILABLE" without warranties of any kind, express or implied. While we strive for 100% accuracy in formatting, parsing, and cryptographic algorithms, SnipTools is not liable for data loss, code errors, or inaccuracies resulting from tool usage.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="border-t border-border-primary pt-6">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-text-primary mb-2">4. Intellectual Property</h2>
        <p>The code, brand assets, and interface design of SnipTools are protected by copyright and intellectual property laws. You retain full ownership of any text, JSON, code snippets, or files you input into our tools.</p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
